    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d381-a4">

                <pb facs="0456" n="396" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg396"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4 in No. 89.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Antananarivo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-01-01"><hi rendition="#italic"
                        >January</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">E. T. Wetter</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Acting United States Consul for Madagascar.</hi></p>
                <p>We, the undersigned, having been honestly besought by Mrs. Waller to place before
                    you the fact that the further detention of Mr. Waller in Tamatave would be, in
                    consequence of his state of health, fatal to him, do respectfully call your
                    attention to the matter, knowing that if Mr. Waller’s health and life be in
                    danger you will, on account of your high official position and duty to an
                    American citizen who is under our protection, do all that you reasonably could
                    to immediately release him from any danger for this reason. We appeal to you to
                    allow Mr. Waller to return to Antananarivo.</p>
                <p>Respectfully submitted,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">James Sibrel</hi>.</item>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">J. C. Ringzett</hi>
                            </item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Henry E. Clark</hi>.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Edith M. Clark</hi>.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">T. T. Matthews</hi>.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Clara Herbert</hi>.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Edith Craven</hi>.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles Inkes</hi>.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">H. Andrew Harvey</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Editor Madagascar News</hi>.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">H. M. Anderson</hi>.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rosra Pairittarison</hi>.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Marc Rabibison</hi>.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rosajin</hi>.</item>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">Andnannana</hi>
                            </item>
                            <item>And thirteen others.</item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
